    50	
    51	Day 49: thirteenth of thirteen, with eleven lines between them and Teague. "I'm free. First time." Something out here hunts Paths, and nobody has given them the reason. Teague has read them and been read. The ford clearance, forty marks, sits on the plank with HOLD and his name beside it, and his crew is going out on the cold road for a week. [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit A2]
