   118	
   119	"I saw the mule. I'm not fighting a mule."
   120	
   121	"Nobody's asked you to fight it. They want it brought home."
   122	
   123	"That's worse," said Lira.
   124	
   125	He read all fourteen from the left post to the right, and then he went back and read them the other way, because he had found what was wrong with them and wished to be sure.
