    14	
    15	"Yes."
    16	
    17	"Is it wrong?"
    18	
    19	"No."
    20	
    21	Pike nodded, and turned his shoulder to the meadow, and said it out over the heads of the people at the plank in his level, carrying voice, so that it went as far as the ash.
    22	
