    19	
    20	Minute twenty-one on a plank table in Thornwater's back room. Ten fragments. A healer who has just felt something change in a patient she cannot read, and who has been told she is about to hear what he is.
    21	
    22	## What this movement is for
    23	
    24	The deliberate quieter movement. Its reason: integration cost, the midpoint disclosure and the birthday, between the Ring and the Stair. Its action is learning. Cael turns nineteen with the lights on inside himself; the Quieting gets its name; Lira hears it first; and the instrument gets a rule before it is ever turned outward. Turns and promises:
    25	
    26	- **The telling on the table** is explicitly a retelling to Oryn of what Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis and Seln already established in edition B6: his own Arbiter woke at Kindling; the station plate lit eleven seconds late; the failed-safe word replaced the old name; the Arbiter then went dark. Sources are named by Path, not by person, except the three Oryn has touched. [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit B4, B7] The notice said aloud. The page fetched from the loft and read twice in its counted places. **Her answer** (protected): "So I couldn't read you because…" … "Then use it on yourself first. Before anyone… I want to be the one you tell." Oryn's new condition governs Tide reading outward: self first, then ask first every time. [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit B4] "You're the colour of the wall…"
