   122	
   123	"No. It gets quicker. On the hill, at the end, I didn't hear myself doing it; it was only a kind of leaning back, all day." He shut the book on the pencil. "I thought that was the worst of what they'd done to me, that I'd got so I could do it in my sleep. I'd have given a good deal not to be good at it."
   124	
   125	"And now?"

