+| Unnamed recurring roles | **KEEP** | All remain role labels; no later owner-name slot is consumed (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:141-193,273-325`; `manuscript/chapter-07.md:29-91,299-307`). |
+| Road craft | **KEEP** | The cairns, chocks, fat, wrapped traces and cut heel-plates support the edge's material logic (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:103-123,129-193,273-305`; `manuscript/chapter-05.md:95`). |
