+| Wash geometry | **KEEP** | It supports the planned day-33 physical problem and does not constrain Movement 2's unrelated ford (`manuscript/chapter-04.md:285-345`). |
+| Stretch geometry | **KEEP** | It implements the packet's forty-five-yard, gravel-fan and hundred-and-ten-yard observations (`manuscript/chapter-05.md:119-257`). |
