+| Sale details | **KEEP** | They execute owner decision #23 and remove both unsuitable assets cleanly (`manuscript/chapter-03.md:63-129`). |
+| Reserve construction and five-thumb rule | **KEEP** | It makes the sealed reserve auditable and is not spent (`manuscript/chapter-03.md:133-185`). |
+| Hold pedagogy and “rent” | **KEEP** | It is the planned learning arc; companion failures do not alter Cael's deployment count (`manuscript/chapter-04.md:3-105`). |
+| Shadow's source habit and dusk history | **KEEP** | It is compatible with Shadow's inherited seal and later two authorized uses (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:239-269`; `manuscript/chapter-04.md:217-243`). |
+| Unnamed recurring roles | **KEEP** | All remain role labels; no later owner-name slot is consumed (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:141-193,273-325`; `manuscript/chapter-07.md:29-91,299-307`). |
+| Road craft | **KEEP** | The cairns, chocks, fat, wrapped traces and cut heel-plates support the edge's material logic (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:103-123,129-193,273-305`; `manuscript/chapter-05.md:95`). |
+| Unnamed flora and deer | **KEEP** | They remain descriptive, not taxonomic canon names, and conflict with no later packet (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:73-87,207-219`). |
+| Wash geometry | **KEEP** | It supports the planned day-33 physical problem and does not constrain Movement 2's unrelated ford (`manuscript/chapter-04.md:285-345`). |
+| Stretch geometry | **KEEP** | It implements the packet's forty-five-yard, gravel-fan and hundred-and-ten-yard observations (`manuscript/chapter-05.md:119-257`). |
