+| Thornwater's physical hold | **KEEP** | A grain hold with gates, loft, platform, yard and east road is compatible with every later Thornwater packet (`manuscript/chapter-06.md:3-107,141-155`). |
+| Carter's map and notation | **KEEP** | It supplies the later packets' required map while leaving quiet ground absent from it (`manuscript/chapter-06.md:195-211`; `manuscript/chapter-07.md:231-259`). |
